From: "Mr.Simi" <mr.simi@MrSimideMacBook-Air-5.local>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 02:05:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] feat(system): one-shot generation-environment bootstrap

SIMIGO_ENV_BOOTSTRAP=1 provisions a bare install to the state where
Execution State and Information Space can run: managed directory tree,
version-locked llama.cpp build into bin (default lock pins the commit
validated in the real environment when no operator manifest exists;
operator manifests are never overwritten), the hf CLI via Homebrew when
absent (adopt-first; manual_required without brew), a blank authoritative
database (existing databases are never reset), and optional
SIMIGO_WORKROOT registration into the roots table. JSON report to
stdout and SIMIGO_ENV_BOOTSTRAP_REPORT. Unit tests cover entry gating,
database round-trip, and stable root ids.
